implementationPlan.description:
Record contract in a new scripts/baseline-report.mjs (Node ESM, LF, node built-ins plus ./usage-report.mjs only). Module doc comment: the contract, the fact that the Moe task status is record-only, and that acceptance = held-out assessment only. Export BASELINE_RECORD_VERSION = 1; BASELINE_STATUSES ['completed','capped','failed','aborted']; BASELINE_ROLES ['architect','worker','qa']; ASSESSMENT_RESULTS ['pass','fail','not-run']; and readBaselineRecord(raw).
The exact record shape, all keys required:
- version: 1;
- workload: { id: category-prefixed kebab <= 80, category: maintenance|defect|refactor|non-routine, caseDigest and snapshotDigest: 'sha256:' + 64 lowercase hex, corpusVersion: positive safe int };
- run: { moeCommit: 40 lowercase hex, startedAt/endedAt: ISO-8601 that round-trip through Date#toISOString, endedAt >= startedAt, wallClockMs and wallClockCapMs: safe ints (cap > 0), status, repetition and repetitionsPlanned: safe ints >= 1 with repetition <= planned, platform/nodeVersion: non-blank <= 64, cliVersion: string <= 128 or null, roles: 1-3 entries { role, cli: non-blank <= 64, model: string <= 128 or null, effort: string <= 32 or null, launches: int or null } unique by role, usageTaskId: an id matching /^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,128}$/ or null, failureReason: string <= 500 or null };
- moeOutcome: { finalStatus: string <= 32 or null, qaApprovals, qaRejections, reopenCount, plannerSessions, repairAttempts: int or null };
- assessment: { ran: boolean, exitCode: int or null, criteria: 0-32 entries { id: kebab <= 64, result } unique by id, reason: string <= 500 or null };
- latency: { firstCodeChangeMs, endToEndMs: int or null };
- retrieval: { sourceRetrievals, retrievedBytes: int or null };
- notes: 0-10 strings <= 300.
Consistency rules: 'capped' requires wallClockMs >= wallClockCapMs; 'completed' requires wallClockMs <= wallClockCapMs; ran false requires exitCode null, every criterion 'not-run' and a non-null reason. Error handling: plain objects only (prototype Object.prototype or null); every failure throws an Error whose message names the field path and reason, bounded to ~200 chars, and never echoes string contents beyond 40 chars. Returns a deep-frozen detached copy (counters stay null when unknown, never coerced). Make the contract cases green: `node --test scripts/tests/usage-report.test.mjs`.
